    "A step's compute part (everything except waiting for data) speeds up in proportion to the target's relative GPU speed, including Python and kernel-launch overhead.",
    "Data preparation costs a fixed number of CPU-seconds per batch and spreads evenly across data-loader workers, up to the target's cores minus the cores the main process uses.",
